        "notes": "Round 1 on Moira is pretty simple. BE ACTIVE.\nRemember you don't have as much sustain as other squishys this early\nso avoid taking 1 v 1s on full hp targets.\nStay near your tank and spam heal orb whenever they are under 75%\nIf you need a big burst of heal fade on top of your tank this will use your phantasm to spawn an extra orb, then send it orb in the same direction. \nThe key to this technique is to get both of the orbs in the same spot as quick as you can.",
